from our study

01:32:24.495 --> 01:32:27.193
and discoveries
in nature on Doctor Yes.

01:32:27.237 --> 01:32:30.109
So many incredible inventions
are to be had.

01:32:30.153 --> 01:32:33.765
Tomorrow we will work on
our design again together.

01:32:33.809 --> 01:32:35.854
I am literally living for it.

01:32:36.594 --> 01:32:39.728
I think Liz would tell you,
if she was here--

01:32:39.771 --> 01:32:41.294
let me speak for her
