01:32:52.218 --> 01:32:53.568
Like, what she says is that,

01:32:53.611 --> 01:32:56.309
every action she takes,
for as long as she lives...

01:32:56.353 --> 01:32:57.528
Mm-hm.

01:32:57.572 --> 01:33:00.096
