01:33:01.010 --> 01:33:03.055
Wow.

01:33:05.188 --> 01:33:06.581
For you?

01:33:06.624 --> 01:33:09.322
Yeah. That's what
she would say.

01:33:09.366 --> 01:33:10.585
Um...

01:33:12.021 --> 01:33:15.241
