01:33:33.042 --> 01:33:35.000
I mean,
we've never really had,

01:33:35.044 --> 01:33:36.741
like, a significant argument.

01:33:36.785 --> 01:33:41.398
And I know that sounds crazy,
but we really don't argue.

01:33:41.441 --> 01:33:42.573
Like, the way
in which we frame--

01:33:42.617 --> 01:33:43.922
You don't argue, ever?

01:33:43.966 --> 01:33:44.836
No.

01:33:46.969 --> 01:33:48.492
Are you able to sense

01:33:48.535 --> 01:33:50.973
