01:33:53.845 --> 01:33:55.499
I don't think she really
gets frustrated with me.

01:33:55.542 --> 01:33:58.197
I know it sounds crazy, like--

01:33:58.850 --> 01:34:00.330
Have you ever asked her?

01:34:01.853 --> 01:34:04.551
I mean,
she tells me just about,

01:34:04.595 --> 01:34:05.770
like,

01:34:05.814 --> 01:34:07.511
