01:34:08.599 --> 01:34:10.296
So you're saying you can sense

01:34:10.340 --> 01:34:12.255
that she would tell you

01:34:12.298 --> 01:34:14.300
if she was frustrated
with you?

01:34:14.344 --> 01:34:17.129
-Yeah.
-Even without you asking?

01:34:17.173 --> 01:34:18.478
Uh-huh.

01:34:22.831 --> 01:34:25.485
Do you feel like she has
a track record of

01:34:25.877 --> 01:34:28.575
