like, pure.

01:35:55.358 --> 01:35:57.012
He really wants to help Liz.

01:35:57.055 --> 01:35:59.841
In 2007,
when I went to pharmaceuticals

01:35:59.884 --> 01:36:01.190
and introduced my machine

01:36:01.233 --> 01:36:03.801
and they started testing it
on patients,

01:36:04.541 --> 01:36:07.457
