01:36:07.849 --> 01:36:09.720
You took 500,000--

01:36:09.764 --> 01:36:11.548
GUARD ACTOR:
Sir, let her go, now!

01:36:13.376 --> 01:36:16.379
Listen. You took 500,000.

01:36:17.510 --> 01:36:20.992
If I push the button,
this whole place will blow!

01:36:22.646 --> 01:36:23.647
