probably should've said--

01:36:26.955 --> 01:36:28.391
I probably should've said two.
Right?

01:36:28.434 --> 01:36:29.696
BILLY: Yeah.

01:36:29.740 --> 01:36:31.742
MAN: Um, at the way
they were scaling.

01:36:31.786 --> 01:36:33.918
So, can you imagine

01:36:33.962 --> 01:36:35.920
like, even when
I recently talked

01:36:35.964 --> 01:36:37.617
