I mean, lies aren't--
It's not lies.

02:36:14.452 --> 02:36:17.150
Like, those aren't lies,
they're, it's--

02:36:17.193 --> 02:36:19.108
It's fuckin' TV. You know.

02:36:19.152 --> 02:36:20.893
If the show hadn't been made,

02:36:20.936 --> 02:36:24.636
people would still have
fucking bullied her

02:36:24.679 --> 02:36:27.987
for what "they think she did."

02:36:28.944 --> 02:36:31.469
When the machine exploded
and blood squirted out

02:36:31.512 --> 02:36:32.818
and then she said,
"You know what?

02:36:32.861 --> 02:36:34.646
"It doesn't matter,"

02:36:34.689 --> 02:36:36.038
did that happen?

02:36:37.910 --> 02:36:39.085
I don't know if she says,

02:36:39.128 --> 02:36:40.608
"You know what?
It didn't matter"

02:36:40.652 --> 02:36:42.610
because she behaved as though,

02:36:42.654 --> 02:36:44.830
"You know what?
It didn't matter."

02:36:45.352 --> 02:36:46.745
-But there's no--
-It's possible

02:36:46.788 --> 02:36:48.442
that she said that.

02:36:49.400 --> 02:36:51.184
But that line is made up.

02:36:51.227 --> 02:36:53.186
Yeah-- We weren't there.

02:36:53.229 --> 02:36:55.231
It's so painful to--

02:36:55.710 --> 02:37:00.672
I'm just-- I'm tired of having
other people speak for me.

02:37:00.715 --> 02:37:01.890
I just...

02:37:03.588 --> 02:37:05.285
I just don't want that
to ever happen again.

02:37:07.461 --> 02:37:10.246
I think this is all Billy
getting into her head.

02:37:10.290 --> 02:37:13.032
What, is it,
it's "a conspiracy now?"

02:37:13.075 --> 02:37:15.338
"Amanda's show?" Okay. Hm.

02:37:15.382 --> 02:37:17.036
NATHAN: Okay.

02:37:17.602 --> 02:37:20.953
So, I'm starting to get
a little nervous because

02:37:20.996 --> 02:37:24.913
we haven't gotten to the thing
that I came to talk about yet.

02:37:24.957 --> 02:37:27.916
And, I just don't know
when Billy's gonna show up.

02:37:27.960 --> 02:37:29.352
Okay, so, um,

02:37:30.528 --> 02:37:32.878
when we were with you
a few years ago,

02:37:32.921 --> 02:37:36.403
back in San Diego, Del Mar,

02:37:36.447 --> 02:37:38.623
did Billy ever
tell you the details

02:37:38.666 --> 02:37:40.059
of the deal he made

02:37:40.102 --> 02:37:42.496
for your involvement
in this project?

02:37:43.584 --> 02:37:45.064
I...

02:37:46.761 --> 02:37:49.677
I'm not really sure
what you mean by that.

02:37:51.462 --> 02:37:54.508
Well he negotiated a contract

02:37:54.552 --> 02:37:58.120
to get paid a portion
of the profits of the film.

02:38:02.777 --> 02:38:05.476
Yeah. I mean, I-- I'm not-

02:38:06.651 --> 02:38:09.349
I'm not really involved in...

02:38:10.089 --> 02:38:13.222
in that, because it's
just not really my thing.

02:38:17.052 --> 02:38:19.402
Billy told me you knew
some of the details

02:38:19.446 --> 02:38:20.882
about the deal he made.

02:38:23.232 --> 02:38:25.583
What details did you know?

02:38:25.626 --> 02:38:27.019
And Liz says,

02:38:27.062 --> 02:38:29.891
"Well, I knew he was talking
to you about it."

02:38:34.417 --> 02:38:37.072
"Well, I knew that he was
talking to you about it."

02:38:40.206 --> 02:38:44.210
So she knew that
when she went upstairs

02:38:44.253 --> 02:38:46.038
to check on the kids,

02:38:46.081 --> 02:38:48.083
that the money stuff
was gonna be...

02:38:49.650 --> 02:38:51.478
discussed,

02:38:51.522 --> 02:38:53.175
'cause she's telling you
she knew.

02:38:54.307 --> 02:38:58.441
And that
clarifies the fact that

02:38:58.485 --> 02:39:01.706
she had knowledge of the deal,
which is very strange.

02:39:01.749 --> 02:39:03.185
Um, and it does start--

02:39:03.229 --> 02:39:05.448
It's starting
to feel like she...

02:39:06.885 --> 02:39:09.540
is just trying
to keep her hands clean.

02:39:11.237 --> 02:39:12.325
'Cause it's interesting,

02:39:12.368 --> 02:39:14.196
'cause when she said that
to me--

02:39:14.240 --> 02:39:16.111
How'd you feel?

02:39:17.678 --> 02:39:20.812
I didn't instantly
receive it as...

02:39:24.163 --> 02:39:26.818
or, "She must be
deceiving me," so...

02:39:28.210 --> 02:39:30.038
maybe she didn't actually
say it like this,

02:39:30.082 --> 02:39:31.431
I'm wondering.

02:39:31.474 --> 02:39:33.172
Maybe she said,

02:39:33.564 --> 02:39:37.611
"Well I knew he was talking
to you about something."

02:39:37.655 --> 02:39:39.526
Not "it."

02:39:41.702 --> 02:39:43.704
Well, those are two
different words, for sure.

02:39:48.187 --> 02:39:49.492
And yeah, I'm...

02:39:51.407 --> 02:39:53.105
I feel confident about that.

02:39:53.148 --> 02:39:55.716
-Okay.
-So, um...

02:39:57.762 --> 02:39:59.851
can you change that
in your script, actually?

02:39:59.894 --> 02:40:02.723
Will you change "it"
to "something"?

02:40:06.858 --> 02:40:10.862
I knew that he was talking
to you about something.

02:40:11.471 --> 02:40:12.820
-You did?
-Yeah.

02:40:12.864 --> 02:40:16.258
Again, this is more his thing.

02:40:16.302 --> 02:40:18.696
We are very separate
on these things.

02:40:21.133 --> 02:40:23.657
I guess what I'm wondering is,

02:40:23.701 --> 02:40:26.094
is this something
that you want?

02:40:26.138 --> 02:40:27.792
Because,

02:40:28.531 --> 02:40:30.533
there still is time
to change it.

02:40:31.665 --> 02:40:33.101
It's not my world.

02:40:33.145 --> 02:40:35.538
And more, it doesn't pertain
to me. You know?

02:40:35.582 --> 02:40:37.758
It was not my focus
at the time.

02:40:37.802 --> 02:40:40.195
How does
it not pertain to you?

02:40:40.239 --> 02:40:41.675
He negotiated a deal

02:40:41.719 --> 02:40:43.155
to profit off
your participation

02:40:43.198 --> 02:40:44.765
in this movie,

02:40:44.809 --> 02:40:47.376
a deal that you're both
gonna benefit from.

02:40:47.420 --> 02:40:48.551
And you keep ringing this bell

02:40:48.595 --> 02:40:50.249
that you don't care
about money.

02:40:50.292 --> 02:40:51.424
-But--
-I don't.

02:40:51.467 --> 02:40:54.514
Okay. So you have
no opinion about

02:40:54.557 --> 02:40:57.822
how turning this thing
into an opportunity for profit

02:40:57.865 --> 02:41:00.912
is going to affect
that perception of you?

02:41:00.955 --> 02:41:03.741
I completely understand
where you're coming from.

02:41:03.784 --> 02:41:06.134
And if you think
it's bad for the project,

02:41:06.178 --> 02:41:07.832
I'll talk to Billy.

02:41:08.441 --> 02:41:11.574
But our finances
are completely separate.

02:41:11.618 --> 02:41:14.273
Come on, Liz.
You have kids together.

02:41:14.316 --> 02:41:17.537
So whether or not she knew
about the financial part

02:41:17.580 --> 02:41:18.886
of the deal is one thing.

02:41:19.974 --> 02:41:22.063
Maybe she did,
maybe she didn't.

02:41:22.847 --> 02:41:26.546
But I could not get a sense
of how she felt about it.

02:41:26.589 --> 02:41:31.812
And it almost seemed like
she had no opinion of her own.

02:41:31.856 --> 02:41:33.161
Let me talk to Billy.

02:41:33.205 --> 02:41:35.163
And I'm sure
whatever the path is,

02:41:35.207 --> 02:41:36.774
it'll be the right one.

02:41:36.817 --> 02:41:39.211
This is so frustrating.

02:41:39.254 --> 02:41:40.865
What does she--
How is she gonna get any help

02:41:40.908 --> 02:41:42.910
if she's just like,

02:41:42.954 --> 02:41:47.219
hiding behind this jackass?

02:41:50.657 --> 02:41:52.659
I find it interesting
that you can be

02:41:52.703 --> 02:41:55.618
someone who doesn't
care about money,

02:41:56.532 --> 02:41:59.971
but you're intertwined
with someone who does.

02:42:00.536 --> 02:42:02.495
-And you're not eager to...
-[SIGHS]

02:42:02.538 --> 02:42:05.193
...influence decisions
in that relationship.

02:42:06.064 --> 02:42:09.197
Does that actually mean
you don't care about money?

02:42:09.241 --> 02:42:11.156
Sort of hard to tell, right?

02:42:11.199 --> 02:42:13.811
Nathan, I don't have the
option to care about money.

02:42:13.854 --> 02:42:18.467
I owe hundreds of millions
of dollars of restitution.

02:42:18.511 --> 02:42:20.469
Every dollar I make,
they take from me.

02:42:21.819 --> 02:42:23.864
I promise I'll talk to him.

02:42:23.908 --> 02:42:26.388
Are you even aware
of the decisions

02:42:26.432 --> 02:42:28.347
he's making on your behalf?

02:42:29.174 --> 02:42:31.306
That photo of yourself
that you hate

02:42:31.350 --> 02:42:33.831
is currently blown up
on billboards

02:42:33.874 --> 02:42:34.745
all across America.

02:42:34.788 --> 02:42:36.224
Yeah. I heard about that.

02:42:36.268 --> 02:42:38.096
He told you about that?

02:42:38.139 --> 02:42:40.228
I mean, he's created
an AI version of you

02:42:40.272 --> 02:42:43.231
that can say
whatever he wants it to say.

02:42:43.275 --> 02:42:45.233
And he's pretending
to be you on Twitter

02:42:45.277 --> 02:42:48.541
and telling people
to go fuck themselves.

02:42:48.584 --> 02:42:50.282
-[SIGHS]
-I can't imagine that these

02:42:50.325 --> 02:42:52.501
are things that you want.

02:42:52.545 --> 02:42:55.504
Billy has his own way
of doing things.

02:42:58.072 --> 02:42:59.857
Okay.

02:43:04.339 --> 02:43:06.864
This whole experience,

02:43:06.907 --> 02:43:10.650
this fire that we're
going through together,

02:43:11.259 --> 02:43:13.174
it's just annealed our love

02:43:13.218 --> 02:43:17.352
in such an intense way.

02:43:18.092 --> 02:43:19.398
"Annealed"?

02:43:19.441 --> 02:43:20.399
Yeah.

02:43:22.444 --> 02:43:24.664
I feel him so deeply.

02:43:27.928 --> 02:43:32.063
Even when I'm in my cell,
alone, you know?

02:43:32.106 --> 02:43:33.716
I...

02:43:34.500 --> 02:43:36.502
I feel him with me,

02:43:36.545 --> 02:43:38.809
and we don't even need
to speak.

02:43:40.027 --> 02:43:43.074
And that's how I talk to him.

02:43:43.117 --> 02:43:45.685
I have conversations
with him in my head.

02:43:47.121 --> 02:43:52.083
And I know what he's feeling,
and what he would say.

02:43:53.214 --> 02:43:54.999
[STRING MUSIC PLAYING]

02:44:03.355 --> 02:44:05.661
Okay, let's keep going.

02:44:07.272 --> 02:44:08.403
I always see these couples

02:44:08.447 --> 02:44:09.883
who've been together
for years and years

02:44:09.927 --> 02:44:11.450
and they're
supposedly in love,

02:44:11.493 --> 02:44:13.844
but you can see
that they're not.

02:44:15.933 --> 02:44:18.936
And I'm like, why? Why?

02:44:21.286 --> 02:44:23.288
Why would you do that
to yourself?

02:44:26.465 --> 02:44:28.641
And I've never had that
with Billy.

02:44:31.165 --> 02:44:33.515
Not once. Not once.

02:44:34.995 --> 02:44:37.650
And I don't have to pretend
with him, you know?

02:44:39.217 --> 02:44:42.873
It's so--
It's just so real with us.

02:44:46.833 --> 02:44:49.662
And we're building monuments
of love

02:44:50.532 --> 02:44:54.232
for each other,
each and every day.

02:44:56.582 --> 02:44:58.801
Oh my God.

02:45:00.760 --> 02:45:02.980
"Ever since Billy
has come into my life,

02:45:03.023 --> 02:45:05.330
"I've become convinced that--"

02:45:05.373 --> 02:45:09.943
Our idea of what
we believe to be God

02:45:09.987 --> 02:45:11.510
is actually love.

02:45:22.869 --> 02:45:24.305
I mean,
I don't know if this is like,

02:45:24.349 --> 02:45:27.874
a Stockholm Syndrome symptom.

02:45:32.009 --> 02:45:36.056
I don't know,
I guess in the moment,

02:45:36.100 --> 02:45:38.841
I thought it was like,

02:45:38.885 --> 02:45:40.495
kind of nice.

02:45:40.539 --> 02:45:43.672
Are you kidding me?
He's the most selfish--

02:45:44.499 --> 02:45:47.024
He's a-- He's a narcissist.

02:45:50.244 --> 02:45:56.381
Well, I think the love
is like, real.

02:45:56.424 --> 02:45:57.773
[PANTING AND GIGGLING]

02:45:57.817 --> 02:45:59.688
ELIZABETH ACTOR: Hi. Hi.

02:45:59.732 --> 02:46:01.386
Hi.

02:46:01.429 --> 02:46:03.954
Oh, you-- Oh.

02:46:03.997 --> 02:46:05.912
I did not sense...

02:46:07.696 --> 02:46:09.220
duress.

02:46:09.872 --> 02:46:12.049
I did not sense fear.

02:46:13.572 --> 02:46:18.577
I sensed just complete,
unbridled,

02:46:18.620 --> 02:46:21.580
genuine love for this man.

02:46:22.494 --> 02:46:23.582
[SCOFFS]

02:46:25.323 --> 02:46:27.020
I caught fast. Come here.

02:46:27.064 --> 02:46:28.717
She looks great, doesn't she?

02:46:28.761 --> 02:46:30.197
Okay, I think
I'm gonna head out.

02:46:30.241 --> 02:46:31.851
I'll give you guys some space.

02:46:31.894 --> 02:46:32.895
You sure you don't wanna stay?

02:46:32.939 --> 02:46:34.027
-Yeah.
-BILLY ACTOR: Okay.

02:46:34.071 --> 02:46:37.161
Let's go outside.
I'll get permission.

02:46:51.914 --> 02:46:53.699
[MUSIC BUILDS]

02:47:13.545 --> 02:47:17.070
-I'm just curious if...
-Yeah?

02:47:19.159 --> 02:47:21.205
...there were moments

02:47:21.248 --> 02:47:24.034
or was a moment
when you guys were alone

02:47:25.078 --> 02:47:27.124
in the prison,

02:47:27.863 --> 02:47:31.606
and I'm just wondering
if there was maybe a moment

02:47:31.650 --> 02:47:35.088
where she was...

02:47:38.091 --> 02:47:41.442
being deceitful
or manipulative...

02:47:43.879 --> 02:47:46.926
and you're not including it,
because you're...

02:47:49.276 --> 02:47:52.018
being protective of her.

02:47:53.280 --> 02:47:56.109
Why would you think
I was doing that?

02:47:58.894 --> 02:48:00.635
I don't know.

02:48:01.723 --> 02:48:04.552
What do you mean?
It's coming from nowhere?

02:48:04.596 --> 02:48:05.901
No, I just feel like

02:48:05.945 --> 02:48:10.384
maybe you're just...

02:48:11.690 --> 02:48:14.736
don't want
to portray something

02:48:14.780 --> 02:48:16.782
that might hurt her.

02:48:16.825 --> 02:48:20.307
Why would I not wanna portray
something that might hurt her?

02:48:21.221 --> 02:48:24.137
Because you care about her.

02:48:32.145 --> 02:48:33.364
I'm not putting--

02:48:33.407 --> 02:48:37.846
I'm not really putting
my feelings into this.

02:48:37.890 --> 02:48:40.110
Or I'm trying not to.
I'm just...

02:48:42.677 --> 02:48:46.681
trying to be accurate.
You know?

02:48:54.472 --> 02:48:56.474
[PIANO MUSIC PLAYING]

02:49:18.887 --> 02:49:20.976
Why? Why're you smiling?

02:49:27.157 --> 02:49:29.246
It's very complicated.
